{"ticker":{"symbol":"ENLT","name":"Enlight Renewable Energy Ltd.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":68.31,"change_pct":0.05498069498069502,"market_cap":9556861952.0,"pe":105.09231,"pb":4.0680084,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":32.87,"week52_high":108.65,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Renewable","country":"Israel","city":"Rosh HaAyin","employees":406,"website":"https://enlightenergy.co.il","business_summary":"Enlight Renewable Energy Ltd operates a renewable energy platform in Israel, the Middle East, North Africa, Europe, the United States, and internationally. The company develops, finances, constructs, owns, and operates utility-scale renewable energy projects. It develops wind energy and solar energy projects, as well as energy storage projects. The company holds a portfolio of renewable energy projects that consists of approximately 20 GW of multi-technology generation capacity and 35.8 GWh of energy storage capacity. The company was incorporated in 1981 and is headquartered in Rosh HaAyin, Israel.","business_summary_ko":"Enlight Renewable Energy Ltd는 이스라엘, 중동, 북아프리카, 유럽, 미국 및 전 세계에서 재생 에너지 플랫폼을 운영하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 유틸리티 규모의 재생 가능 에너지 프로젝트를 개발, 자금 조달, 건설, 소유 및 운영합니다. 풍력 에너지와 태양 에너지 프로젝트뿐만 아니라 에너지 저장 프로젝트도 개발합니다. 이 회사는 약 20GW의 다중 기술 발전 용량과 35.8GWh의 에너지 저장 용량으로 구성된 재생 에너지 프로젝트 포트폴리오를 보유하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 1981년에 설립되었으며 이스라엘 Rosh HaAyin에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":2540241000.0,"rev_lo":2508000000.0,"rev_hi":2598569000.0,"rev_g":0.6804,"n":3,"eps":1.38,"eps_lo":1.38,"eps_hi":1.38,"eps_g":2.2694001},{"period":"2027","rev":3518088000.0,"rev_lo":3234232000.0,"rev_hi":4142046000.0,"rev_g":0.3849,"n":6,"eps":1.05837,"eps_lo":0.50645,"eps_hi":1.65246,"eps_g":1.07}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"신재생 에너지","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":192172000.0,"operating_income":76845000.0,"net_income":24749000.0,"eps":0.25},{"period":"2023","revenue":261142000.0,"operating_income":104849000.0,"net_incom